EmailTemplate.textOnly:
Hello {!Contact.FirstName},

Thank you for your interest in Arizona State University. Have you heard of our Maricopa to ASU Pathways Program (MAPP)? Students who sign up for a MAPP take a specific list of courses at their community college. These courses will satisfy all lower-division coursework required for their selected ASU major, while also fulfilling all requirements to complete an associate degree. If you are interested in this program, you can sign up for it with your community college advisor.

You can view more information and look up a specific MAPP at https://transfer.asu.edu/maricopa.

Please contact me if you have additional questions.

{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}
Admission Services
{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}
{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}
{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}

If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.

